# netty-codec-http2 4.1.135.Final - HTTP/2 DATA-frame ByteBuf leak (OOM DoS). Not reachable: the
# vulnerable DelegatingDecompressorFrameListener is installed only when HTTP/2 request decompression
# is on (Vert.x VertxHttp2ConnectionHandler.onSettingsRead), and it is off - Quarkus
# enable-decompression defaults false, is build-time only, and we set it nowhere. Verified against
# keycloak:26.6.4: a gzip+Content-Encoding request body is NOT decompressed (positive control: same
# image rebuilt with the flag on does decompress). See: UID2-7612
CVE-2026-56819 exp:2026-09-29
