# CVE-2026-40983 — io.micrometer:micrometer-core (bundled in Keycloak image) (HIGH).
# Not exploitable here: micrometer-core-1.16.3.jar is bundled by the Keycloak base image
# (Dockerfile_keycloak -> quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:26.6.4); not a declared dependency (no
# match in package.json/package-lock.json). CVE is in Micrometer gRPC server instrumentation.
# Keycloak is a Quarkus HTTP/HTTPS OIDC server started with --metrics-enabled=true exposing a
# Prometheus HTTP endpoint; it runs no gRPC server and registers no Micrometer gRPC
# interceptor. No 'grpc' reference anywhere in repo; compose exposes only HTTP ports 8080/9990.
# See: UID2-7655
CVE-2026-40983 exp:2026-11-11

